SUMMARY:Sonic Journey Through Sound
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\n**Start Your Work Week with a Sound Me
 ditation:**\n[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3pm](https://somaticsounds.net/events
 /)\n**\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link** [https://somaticsound
 s.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n\nSonic Journey Through
  Sound\nCome experience a somatic journey where ancient wisdom meets moder
 n well-being — a multidimensional soundscape\, richer and more textured 
 than a traditional sound bath. Vivek guides each session with over 40 hand
 crafted singing bowls\, layered with binaural beats to support deep relaxa
 tion and nervous system regulation. Participants leave feeling settled in 
 the body and quiet in the mind.\n\nYoga mats\, pillows\, and blankets are 
 provided.\n\nThis event is open to all levels—whether you’re a seasone
 d mindfulness enthusiast\, exploring a novel path to relaxation\, or simpl
 y seeking stress relief.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot please use Event 
 Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3pm](https://somaticsound
 s.net/events/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
