 tps://somaticsounds.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n\nSon
 ic Journey Through Sound\nCome experience a somatic journey where ancient 
 wisdom meets modern well-being — a multidimensional soundscape\, richer 
 and more textured than a traditional sound bath. Vivek guides each session
  with over 40 handcrafted singing bowls\, layered with binaural beats to s
 upport deep relaxation and nervous system regulation. Participants leave f
 eeling settled in the body and quiet in the mind.\n\nYoga mats\, pillows\,
  and blankets are provided.\n\nThis event is open to all levels—whether 
 you’re a seasoned mindfulness enthusiast\, exploring a novel path to rel
 axation\, or simply seeking stress relief.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot
  please use Event Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am & 3pm](ht
 tps://somaticsounds.net/events/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
