SUMMARY:Sound Healing: The Final Month in Asheville
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\nNovember is the final month of session
 s here in Asheville before I move to South Florida. If you've been meaning
  to come\, or want one more journey together\, now is the time.\n\nI want 
 to Thank Asheville for all the support!\n\n**Start Your Work Week with a S
 ound Meditation:**\n[Every Weekend ](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)Ses
 sions @ 11am\, 3pm\, 6pm\n**\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link**
  [https://somaticsounds.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n\
 nCome immerse yourself in a somatic journey of sound and relaxation\, wher
 e ancient wisdom meets modern well‑being. The soothing tones of Himalaya
 n singing bowls wash over you\, calming the mind and renewing the spirit.\
 n\nFacilitated by Vivek\, this sound journey features over 40 handcrafted 
 singing bowls\, each rich with deeply somatic frequencies and overtones. B
 inaural beats are layered in to support deeper relaxation\, meditation\, a
 nd nervous system regulation. Together they create a soundscape that goes 
 far beyond a traditional sound bath\, inviting clarity\, release\, and inn
 er spaciousness.\n\nOpen to all levels\, whether you're new to this or hav
 e been practicing for years.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot please use Ev
 ent Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am & 6pm](https://somatics
 ounds.net/events/)**\nOr\n**[Contact Vivek](https://somaticsounds.net/cont
 act/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/inner-peace-collective/events/tbglbvy
 jcpbcb/
